WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
BUILD 080. THE ARTICLE WAS ONLY THE FIRST OUTPUT.. A fictional story can open into reusable public infrastructure without becoming a completeness claim.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
UNFOLD THE REPORTING PIPELINE. STORY · INTERVIEW · FIELD · RECORD · QUESTION. Every synthetic source retains its date, rights state, verification state, limitations, and unknowns.

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
EXTRACT CANDIDATE ASSETS. DATASET · TOOL · TRACKER · TIMELINE · PUBLIC RESOURCE. Source-linked candidates enter review without being published, prioritized, or promoted into verified facts.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
QUEUE THE MAINTENANCE WORK. OWNER · UPDATE PATH · EVIDENCE GAP. Each opportunity keeps human review, unresolved rights, maintenance requirements, and missing evidence visible.

5
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
BOUND THE RESULT. PUBLICATION IS A BEGINNING. Fictional reporting assets only; no real source, person, rights clearance, completeness, demand, priority, legal, medical, or outcome claim.

6
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
SAVE THIS. REPORTING CAN BECOME PUBLIC INFRASTRUCTURE.. EXTRACT REUSABLE ASSETS. RETAIN SOURCE, RIGHTS, DATE, STATUS, LIMITS, UNKNOWNS, OWNER, AND UPDATE PATH.

